  "Description": {
    "Cost": 2173929,
    "UIName": "Talos",
    "Id": "chassisdef_talos_TLS-BC",
    "Name": "Talos",
    "Details": "This <i>Talos 1B</i> bears an eclectic mixture of technologies spanning from the days of the Star League all through to the end of the Clan Invasion. In fact, it's quite possible that the very same equipment that saw the SLDF leave also saw them return in the form of the Clans.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Pilot</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.1</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Lower</color>",
